    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "primary_message": "In a large pitcher, combine tomato juice, shochu, sake, teriyaki sauce, ginger brine, miso paste, lime juice, wasabi powder, and 1 tablespoon togarashi. Stir well until miso paste is fully dissolved.",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "primary_message": "On a small plate, combine salt and 1 tablespoon togarashi. Run a lime wedge around the rim of 6 tall beer or Collins glasses and coat edge with salt/togarashi mixture. Place a lime wedge on the edge of each glass and fill with ice.",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "primary_message": "Pour cocktail into glasses and garnish each one with a cocktail skewer threaded with 2 pieces of pickled ginger.",
      "secondary_message": null
    }
